source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: A run of four backslashes hides the closer and renders literally; jiro refuses the span too, but its plain text reads two backslashes where Jira shows four.
